Make the Bazel build work inside the Nix sandbox: use the Nix provided
clang, Python, Go and CMake toolchains instead of the ones the upstream
MODULE.bazel downloads, drop the dev-only extensions (LLVM, Rust, OCI,
buildifier), fix shebangs in rules_cc and rules_foreign_cc, and route
the two Go modules pbgen and rules_go need through Bazel's repository cache.

